      "value": "What's the processing time difference? I've been meaning to evangelize ASTC textures but I may need to figure out how to extract the processed files out of unity somehow, so I send ASTC 8x8 instead of PNG\n\nI found external tool but it takes 5x time and flips horizontally. Compressonator from AMD. With Intel/Nvidia\n\nI've also tried a few tools that don't give textures that unity editor likes",
